# REQUIREMENTS

## Hardware
- Architecture: x86-64 or ARM64 (tested: Ubuntu 24.04 x86-64,
  macOS 14 ARM64)
- RAM: 8 GB minimum, 16 GB recommended
- Storage: X GB (sample test only); ~X GB for full reproduction
  (X GB archives + X GB extracted + Docker image)
- No GPU required.

## Software
- Docker >= 24 (recommended path), OR
- Python >= 3.10 with pip (local path)
- All Python dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and
  pinned in requirements-lock.txt.

## Network
- No network access needed at runtime. No API keys, no external
  services. All experiments are offline analysis of pre-recorded
  trajectories.
